{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09528","headline":"赠乔琳 · 张谓","name":"赠乔琳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年上策不见收，今年寄食仍淹留。\n羡君有酒能便醉，羡君无钱能不忧。\n如今五侯不爱客，羡君不问五侯宅。\n如今七贵方自尊，羡君不过七贵门。\n丈夫会应有知己，世上悠悠何足论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}